OL,3,AHouthi missile strike on Yemen camp
OL,4,Akills 50 security recruits, local
OL,5,Aauthorities say
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore than 50 security personnel have
OL,8,Fbeen killed and 200 injured in a Houthi
OL,9,Fmissile strike on a camp in Yemen's
OL,10,Fcentral province of Shabwa, local
OL,11,Fauthorities say.
OL,13,FA spokesman for the Saudi-backed Yemeni
OL,14,Farmed forces said the Iran-backed group
OL,15,Flaunched three ballistic missiles at
OL,16,Fal-Alam camp near Ataq city, which was
OL,17,Fbeing used as a training centre for
OL,18,Frecruits to the security forces and
OL,19,Fpolice.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
