OL,3,AHouthi missile strike on Yemen camp
OL,4,Akills 50 security recruits, local
OL,5,Aauthorities say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe head of Yemen's Presidential
OL,8,FLeadership Council, Rashad al-Alimi,
OL,9,Fcondemned what he called the "criminal
OL,10,Fattack" and promised a "firm response".
OL,12,FThe Houthis' military spokesman said
OL,13,Fthey had targeted "Saudi enemy
OL,14,Fconcentrations".
